Z||000005||reddog||10-05-2001||07:35 PM||||Well I took out my seats and put in the new Corbeau Carreras and they look sweeeeet! They fit everywhere but the shoulder area where they stick out a little in front on the center console but not enough to impede the openning and closing of the glove box door. They do slide back as far as stock and the shoulder area only keeps it about 1/2 inch from the firewall. I really love the seats and recommend them to anyone who wants to replace their old dry rotten buckets with something wild. The yellow really stands out with my yellow faced gauges. I will post the pics soon! ||||reg||6
